: "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201206/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 229093, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201106/t20110624_229093.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市第六次全国人口普查领导小组办公室\n　　三明市统计局\n　　2011年6 月 25 日\n　　根据《全国人口普查条例》和国务院的决定，我国以2010年11月1日零时为标准时点进行了第六次全国人口普查[2]。在各级人民政", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201106/t20110624_229093.htm", "docreltime": "2011.06.25 08:37:00", "doctitle": "三明市2010年第六次全国人口普查主要数据公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 231169, "sourcename": "市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201106/t20110624_229093.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201106/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 226483, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201103/t20110313_226483.htm", "content": "\n　　2010年，在市委、市政府的正确领导下，全市上下认真贯彻落实科学发展观，贯彻落实党中央、国务院和省委、省政府加快建设海峡西岸经济区决策部署，实施好“五大战役”，全力推进三明科学发展、跨越发展，经济社会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201103/t20110313_226483.htm", "docreltime": "2011.03.13 09:00:00", "doctitle": "2010年三明市国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 228559, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201103/t20110313_226483.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 217359, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201003/t20100321_217359.htm", "content": "\n　　（2010年3月16日）\n　　2009年，在市委、市政府的正确领导下，全市各级各部门以科学发展观统领经济社会发展全局，按照“加快建设海峡西岸经济区”、“科学发展，四求先行”的要求，加快实施“工业强市、生态立市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201003/t20100321_217359.htm", "docreltime": "2010.03.21 13:18:00", "doctitle": "2009年三明市国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 219434, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201003/t20100321_217359.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/201003/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 211775, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200907/t20090722_211775.htm", "content": "\n　　根据国务院颁布《住房公积金管理条例》第三十二条规定，经三明市第二届住房公积金管理委员会第三次会议审议通过，现将三明市2008年度住房公积金归集和使用情况向社会公报如下：\n　　一、住房公积金归集和提取情", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200907/t20090722_211775.htm", "docreltime": "2009.07.22 10:24:00", "doctitle": "2008年三明市住房公积金执行公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 213850, "sourcename": "市住房公积金管理中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200907/t20090722_211775.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200907/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 210255, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200906/t20090604_210255.htm", "content": "\n　　一、综述\n　　2008年，我市环境保护工作以科学发展观为指导，以保障环境安全、改善环境质量、维护群众环境权益为根本出发点，以主要污染物总量减排为工作主线，扎实推进污染防治与生态保护，为促进我市经济社会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200906/t20090604_210255.htm", "docreltime": "2009.06.04 10:39:00", "doctitle": "2008年三明市环境保护状况公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 212330, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200906/t20090604_210255.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200906/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 208651, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200904/t20090401_208651.htm", "content": "\n　　2008年，在市委、市政府的正确领导下，全市各级各部门以科学发展观统领经济社会发展全局，按照“四求先行”、“四个重在”的要求，坚持项目带动、品牌带动，着力民心、着力民生，加快落实“强化主轴、壮大两翼、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "2008年三明市国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200904/t20090401_208651.htm", "docreltime": "2009.04.01 16:11:00", "doctitle": "三明市2008年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 210726, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200904/t20090401_208651.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200904/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203964, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203964.htm", "content": "　　2007年，在市委、市政府的领导下，全市上下以邓小平理论、“三个代表”重要思想和党的十七大精神为指导，落实科学发展观，构建和谐社会，积极发挥“前锋、基地、枢纽、支撑”作用，主动融入海峡西岸经济区建设，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203964.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 15:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市2007年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206039, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203964.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203963, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203963.htm", "content": "\n　　2006年，在市委、市政府的领导下，全市上下以邓小平理论和“三个代表”重要思想为指导，落实科学发展观，全面建设小康社会，构建社会主义和谐社会，主动融入海峡西岸建设，经过全市人民的共同努力，国民经济呈现", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203963.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 15:36:00", "doctitle": "三明市2006年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206038, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203963.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203962, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203962.htm", "content": "\n　　在市委、市政府的领导下，全市人民高举邓小平理论和“三个代表”重要思想伟大旗帜，全面贯彻党的十六届三中、四中、五中全会精神，树立和落实科学发展观，以开展保持共产党员先进性教育活动为动力，主动融入海峡", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203962.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 15:32:00", "doctitle": "三明市2005年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206037, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203962.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203961, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203961.htm", "content": "　　2004年，在市委、市政府的坚强领导下，我市以“三个代表”重要思想为指导，全面贯彻党的十六大和十六届三中、四中全会精神，牢固树立和落实科学发展观，主动融入海峡西岸经济区建设，迎难而上，顽强拼搏，全力加", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203961.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 15:18:00", "doctitle": "三明市2004年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206036, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203961.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203960, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203960.htm", "content": "\n　　2003年，在市委、市政府的正确领导下，面对突如其来的非典疫情和历史罕见的持续干旱，面对复杂的国际形势和繁重的改革发展稳定任务，全市人民以“三个代表”重要思想为指导，全面贯彻党的十六大、十六届三中全会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203960.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 15:08:00", "doctitle": "三明市2003年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206035, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203960.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203959, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203959.htm", "content": "\n　　2002年，全市人民在市委、市政府的正确领导下，认真贯彻落实“三个代表”重要思想和党的十六大精神，在“强市富民，发展三明”的目标指引下，牢牢把握“抓住机遇、深化改革、扩大开放、促进发展、保持稳定”的基", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203959.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:48:00", "doctitle": "三明市2002年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206034, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203959.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203958, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203958.htm", "content": "\n　　2001年是新世纪的起首之年，也是“十五”计划实施的第一年。全市人民在市委、市政府的领导下，以邓小平理论和江总书记“三个代表”重要思想为指导，围绕市第六次党代会提出的“强市富民，发展三明”的目标和各项", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203958.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市2001年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206033, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203958.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203957, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203957.htm", "content": "\n　　根据国务院的决定，我国于2000年11月进行了第五次全国人口普查。在国务院、省政府、市政府和地方各级政府的统一领导下，在全市人民的支持配合下，通过全市2万多普查工作人员的艰苦努力，圆满完成了人口普查的现", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203957.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:39:00", "doctitle": "三明市2000年第五次全国人口普查主要数据公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206032, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203957.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203956, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203956.htm", "content": "\n　　2000年，全市人民在市委、市政府的领导下，坚持以邓小平理论和江泽民总书记“三个代表”重要思想为指导，认真贯彻落实党中央、国务院和省委、省政府一系列工作部署，围绕年初市委作出的“抓好一个环节（推进以国", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203956.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:35:00", "doctitle": "三明市2000年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206031, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203956.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203955, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203955.htm", "content": "\n　　1999年，全市人民在市委、市政府的领导下，坚持以邓小平理论和党的十五大精神为指导，认真贯彻落实以扩大内需为主的一系列方针政策，抓住机遇，拼搏进取，克服各种困难，稳步推进各项改革，实施科教兴市和可持续", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203955.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:31:00", "doctitle": "三明市1999年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206030, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203955.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203954, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "统计公报", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203954.htm", "content": "\n　　1998年，我市坚持以邓小平理论和党的十五大精神为指导，认真贯彻党中央、国务院和省委、省政府的一系列重大决策和部署，积极应对亚洲金融危机，扩大内需，增加投入，注重经济增长的效益和质量，稳步推进各项改革", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203954.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.21 11:27:00", "doctitle": "三明市1998年国民经济和社会发展统计公报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206029, "sourcename": "三明市统计局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/t20080821_203954.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/tjxx/tjgb/200808/", "rels": []}]}